sion:**\n   - Summarize the process: \"To find the flavor with the most students, we list the numbers, sort them, and identify the largest number. The flavor corresponding to this number is the one with the most students.\"\n\nBy breaking down the process and providing clear examples, you can help a student understand how to compare numbers and identify the largest value. This approach makes the concept more accessible and easier to grasp. <\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>",
