messages:  ["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nPublic products refer to products provided by the public sector to meet the public needs of society. Among them, pure public products refer to the consumption of a certain item by any one person without reducing the consumption of other people.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is a pure public product?\n# Options:\nA) National defense of a country\nB) Expressway tolls due to congestion\nC) Free parks built in the city\nD) Free gifts provided by the mall\n<think>\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the definition of a pure public product and analyze each option provided.\nThe correct option is:"]
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-459fb0492b994ddaba30bfa94b4d27ac",
