sage of the passage. Look for any contradictions or inconsistencies between the option and the context.\n\n7. **Practice Regularly**: Logical reasoning problems can be challenging, so regular practice will help improve your skills and speed.\n\nBy following these steps, you can systematically approach logical reasoning problems and increase your chances of selecting the correct answer. If you have any specific questions or need further examples, feel free to ask!\n</answer>",
