**\n     - This option emphasizes adapting to the development and changes in rural areas, which is somewhat related but not as precise as the context suggests.\n   - **Option C: Connected with and integrated with the reality of the local rural society**\n     - This option directly addresses the idea that external culture should be integrated with the local reality, which aligns closely with the paragraph\'s emphasis on reality and local conditions.\n   - **Option D: Adapted to the development of advanced culture**\n     - This option is too narrow and does not capture the broader idea of integrating with local reality as emphasized in the context.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - Option C best captures the essence of the paragraph, as it emphasizes the integration of external culture with the local reality of the rural society.\nThe correct option is:']
