nces, so this option is not directly refuted.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - Option C is the one that is directly refuted by the context. The context explicitly states that the beauty of the mountain scene is beautiful even if no one appreciates it, which directly contradicts the idea that beauty is only in the eyes of people.\nThe correct option is:']
