messages:  ['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe cultural industry integrates intensive talent, technology, knowledge and capital, and has distinct cross-disciplinary, cross-disciplinary, cross-time-space and cross-cultural characteristics. It will also play a central role in future personal behavior, social life and nation-building, as well as global development and human affairs. Report of the World Commission on Culture and Development of the United Nations Scientific, Educational and Cultural Organization in 1995. It is pointed out that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence. It can be said that the cross-border characteristics and importance of culture put forward fundamental requirements for the high quality and scale of cultural talents.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the main content of this text?\n# Options:\nA) Cultural industry plays an important role in human social life\nB) Cultural talents should have high quality and scale\nC) Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development\nD) The particularity and importance of cultural industry\n<think>\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s break down the context and question step by step:\n\n1. **Context Analysis**:\n   - The context discusses the cultural industry, highlighting its characteristics and importance.\n   - It mentions that the cultural industry integrates various elements like talent, technology, knowledge, and capital.\n   - The text emphasizes the cross-disciplinary, cross-time-space, and cross-cultural nature of the cultural industry.\n   - It states that the cultural industry will play a central role in future personal behavior, social life, and nation-building.\n   - The report from the World Commission on Culture and Development of UNESCO in 1995 further emphasizes the importance of culture as the ultimate goal and destination for overall human prosperity and development.\n   - The text also notes that the cross-border characteristics and importance of culture require high-quality and scale cultural talents.\n\n2. **Question Analysis**:\n   - The question asks for the main content of the text.\n   - We need to identify the central theme or the primary focus of the passage.\n\n3. **Option Analysis**:\n   - **Option A**: "Cultural industry plays an important role in human social life"\n     - This option aligns with the text\'s emphasis on the cultural industry\'s role in future personal behavior, social life, and nation-building.\n   - **Option B**: "Cultural talents should have high quality and scale"\n     - While this is mentioned in the text, it is not the main focus. It is a specific requirement for cultural talents.\n   - **Option C**: "Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development"\n     - This is mentioned in the context but is not the main focus. It is a broader statement about the importance of culture.\n   - **Option D**: "The particularity and importance of cultural industry"\n     - This option is too broad and does not capture the main emphasis of the text, which is more about the role and importance of the cultural industry.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - The text primarily discusses the role and importance of the cultural industry in various aspects of human life and development.\n   - The most comprehensive and central theme is the role of the cultural industry in human social life.\nThe correct option is:']
